SUMMARY:The Many vs The Money: Counter-Summit and Demo - by The Many Vs The
  Money
LOCATION:OCAD U
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.manyvsmoneysummit.ca/\n\nHosted by The
  Many Vs The Money (https://www.manyvsmoneysummit.ca/)\n\nThe CEOs of
  BlackRock\, Blackstone and other representatives of the global 1% are
  coming to Toronto at the invitation of Prime Minister Mark Carney\, to
  simultaneously auction off Canadian public resources and infrastructure
  — from our airports and water systems\, to highways and ports — and
  finance destructive megaprojects like AI data centers\, weapons
  factories\, and toxic pipelines. We refuse to let the global 1% descend
  on our city unopposed.
END:VEVENT
