 hayfCbypUZCM__2Bg/viewform?embedded=true\n\nHosted by Rania El Mugammar
  (https://www.raniawrites.com/)\n\n​This workshop is for parents\,
  caregivers\, auncles\, grandparents\, guardians\, and all who want to be
  in liberatory community with children. Discuss how to explain our current
  conditions to little ones\, how to equip them (and ourselves) and how to
  organize alongside them to resist and transform our realities.
END:VEVENT
