 f-the-anti-trans-backlash-tickets-1992263968159\n\nHosted by Another Story
  Bookshop (https://anotherstory.ca/home)\n\nJoin Lamble to discuss their
  new book Unsafe: The Carceral Roots of the Anti-Trans Backlash! Unsafe is
  a clear-eyed and decisive challenge to the toxic ideas at the heart of
  the gender wars\, exposing how carceral approaches to safety fail to
  address root causes of harm\, ultimately deepening social divisions and
  violence.
