DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.tickettailor.com/events/panitchschool/2323358\n\nHosted by
  The Leo Panitch School for Socialist Education
  (https://leopanitchschool.ca/)\n\nWaking up from the capitalist nightmare
  requires a clear understanding of what we are up against: how we
  understand capitalism\, how it works\, and how it compels us to act in
  certain ways. This is the first of 7 week course to work through An
  Introduction to the Three Volumes of Karl Marx’s Capital by Michael
  Heinrich together.
